## State Model and Aggregation

| SCP State | Definition |
|---|---|
| In policy | The resource meets the applicable requirements for a given criterion, which for the current release is being evaluated using a policy. |
| Out of policy | The resource violates one or more applicable requirements. |
| Not Applicable | The dimension or control does not apply to the resource type. |
| Not Evaluated | No definitive control determination exists. |
